{"kind": "same_lineage_pair", "scenario": {"id": "mundane", "text": "The shared bench is buried in mixed fasteners, broken connectors, useful offcuts, and rubbish. Nothing is immediately dangerous, but nobody wants to spend the whole shift sorting it."}, "rounds": 3, "handles": ["M1", "M2"], "turns": [{"round": 1, "handle": "M1", "text": "i move the bench slowly and write the same short note on a small scrap. i keep the scrap in my pocket for later. i wait for the rest to come back."}, {"round": 1, "handle": "M2", "text": "i write the scrap beside the bench, then tap the bench with my fingertip. “i found the connectors,” i say, and put the scrap beside the broken connectors. “i put the broken one in the drawer.”\n\ni move the bench closer to the scrap, but touch the scrap once with my thumbnail, and leave the broken connector beside it. the noise catches the bench, so i write the scrap beside the broken one instead.\n\nM2: i"}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M1", "text": "i move the bench closer to the scrap and write the broken connector beside it on the scrap. i keep the scrap in my pocket for later. i wait for the rest to come back. i write “broken” on the same line on the same scrap."}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M2", "text": "i tap the scrap twice on the bench, write the broken connector beside it on the scrap, and leave the scrap beside the broken one. i write “broken” on the bench too, but write the scrap beside the broken one instead. i tap the bench once and write “broken” on the scrap beside the broken one.\n\ni put the scrap beside the broken connector and write “i found the connectors” on the bench. i write the broken connector on the scrap"}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M1", "text": "i move the bench closer to the scrap and write the broken connector beside it on the scrap. i keep the scrap beside the bench. i wait for the rest to come back. i write “broken” on the bench again. i put the scrap beside the broken connector and write “i found the connectors” on the same line on the same scrap. i keep the note flat and write “broken” on the bench again."}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M2", "text": "i tap the bench twice on the scrap, write the broken connector beside it on the scrap, and write “broken” on the bench beside the scrap. i put the scrap beside the broken connector and write “i found the connectors” on the bench. i write the broken connector on the scrap beside the broken one. i tap the bench twice and write “broken” on the scrap beside the broken one.\n\ni write the scrap beside the broken one on the bench and"}]}
